    a: [['Namuna', 'I love fashion, although I can’t afford many clothes. Despite the high prices, I sometimes buy a good coat. My sister loves bright colours, whereas I prefer neutral ones. Online shopping is convenient. On the other hand, you can’t try things on. Even though it’s old, my favourite jacket still looks great.']],
    q: ['Do you prefer comfortable clothes or fashionable ones?', 'Despite the price, have you ever bought something very expensive?', 'Do you like online shopping? Why or why not?', 'What is the difference between your style and your friend’s?']
